Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.14,0:04:32.77,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\fnGeorgia\fscx90\fax-0.13\b1\fs7\c&H41334B&\frz344.5\frx18\pos(310.86,252)}We certify that the above is a student of this university
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.41,0:04:32.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your student ID, don't lose it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.63,0:04:35.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Starting today, you're\NDaigo Oshima, a third year.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.99,0:04:37.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.25,0:04:40.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, ma 'am, this is sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.53,0:04:43.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But could we maybe,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.29,0:04:49.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if it's possible, go to a drinking party?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.45,0:04:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but that's a risk\Nwe don't need to take.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.63,0:04:54.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, can I go?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.63,0:05:01.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, only this once, though.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:06.01,0:05:09.47,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnGeorgia\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\fscx90\fscy120\fax-0.11\fs20\b1\pos(276,78)\frz6.409\frx0\fry344\c&HE4FBF8&}Shinei College Camping Club
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.25,0:05:08.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, who's up next?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.57,0:05:15.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Shiori Ureshino, a\Nfirst-year economics major…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.85,0:05:19.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I like…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.35,0:05:26.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did it again?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.87,0:05:27.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.77,0:05:46.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am pleased to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.43,0:05:49.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.41,0:05:51.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, thanks a lot for that introduction.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.21,0:05:53.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, next person.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.49,0:06:00.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you handle a party, Gero?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.17,0:06:04.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had drinks with the\NBugmaster loads of times.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.65,0:06:05.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got me worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.09,0:06:07.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd better sneak in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.81,0:06:08.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.23,0:06:11.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not just a master assassin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.71,0:06:13.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm also the life of the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.25,0:06:17.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Name's Oshima. Econ major.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.85,0:06:20.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now observe as I chug eight pints at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.43,0:06:25.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this, a 90s movie?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.71,0:06:33.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now for the grand finale.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.25,0:06:43.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should call an ambulance, shouldn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.61,0:07:00.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here comes the applause.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.95,0:07:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great to meet you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.97,0:07:06.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a water-absorbent palmer!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.15,0:07:08.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's completely harmless!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.03,0:07:10.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's nasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.07,0:07:14.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anybody else who hasn't\Nintroduced themselves?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.21,0:07:16.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, man, you're up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.65,0:07:18.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:19.18,0:07:20.15,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,350)\bord1\shad0\b1\fs18\fax-0.76\fscx90\3c&H7A9597&\frz332.1\pos(226,234)}Ultimate Relaxation
Dialogue: 1,0:07:19.18,0:07:20.15,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,350)\bord1\shad0\b1\fs18\fax-0.76\fscx90\3c&H7A9597&\frz332.1\pos(186.85,257.72)}Man of the Alps
Dialogue: 1,0:07:19.18,0:07:20.15,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,350)\bord1\shad0\b1\fs18\fax-0.76\fay0.03\fscx90\3c&H7A9597&\frz332.1\pos(144,279.43)}Campfire ASMR
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.83,0:07:31.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name's Naruko.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.69,0:07:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.15,0:07:37.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about your first name? Your major?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.79,0:07:38.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, stuff like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.79,0:07:39.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's unimportant.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.47,0:07:41.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.38,0:07:45.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing that truly matters\Nis that I was fortunate enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.31,0:07:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to meet all of you here in this moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.61,0:07:50.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For that, I thank my lucky stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.23,0:07:52.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's his deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.43,0:07:54.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's been spaced out this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.91,0:07:57.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Super thank them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.39,0:07:59.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That had no substance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.05,0:08:01.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And why did he say it twice?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.11,0:08:02.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I searched for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.11,0:08:03.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My true love.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.55,0:08:08.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Naruko, is the seat taken?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.39,0:08:11.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How come I can't make a first\Nimpression as good as this weirdo?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.05,0:08:13.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gotta be his looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.95,0:08:17.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These drinking parties, it\Nappears they have hidden depths.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.87,0:08:22.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this all?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.25,0:08:26.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, Ureshino.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.05,0:08:27.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.33,0:08:30.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't lash out at her\Nbecause you're trick-bombed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.63,0:08:32.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear, if you make her cry...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.39,0:08:33.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.35,0:08:34.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't say anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.59,0:08:39.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just don't understand why you're\Nforcing yourself to go to these.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.97,0:08:43.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get you're inheriting a company and\Ntrying to overcome your social anxiety,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.75,0:08:45.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but there's no need to force yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.53,0:08:50.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.44,0:08:51.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.37,0:08:52.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really, ghetto?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.47,0:08:56.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.45,0:08:59.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just overwhelmed you\Ncare about how I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.15,0:09:04.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The truth is, it's not about the company.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.19,0:09:09.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I want is to be able to\Nfit in with everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.47,0:09:16.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When my dad reached the\Nend, he said to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.13,0:09:25.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should give drinking a try, but\Nbe sure to wait until you're twenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.79,0:09:33.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My Shiori, you're a nice\Ngirl, I mean that, but
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.81,0:09:36.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you worry too much about\Nwhat other people think.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.21,0:09:40.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trust me you've got to\Ntake everything that's
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.43,0:09:44.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pent up inside and bam let it all out like
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.73,0:09:49.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a Firework enjoy life\Nand the time you have
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.53,0:09:54.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with others above all\Nelse i want that for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.37,0:10:07.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.83,0:10:09.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even here, with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.83,0:10:11.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still freeze up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.85,0:10:13.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the words refuse to come up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.73,0:10:15.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It takes time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.49,0:10:16.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.73,0:10:17.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.81,0:10:19.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hardest part is taking the first step.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.89,0:10:22.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After that everyone will accept me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.93,0:10:25.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I can't help worrying.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.59,0:10:29.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if they get sick of me\Nthe moment I open my mouth?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.53,0:10:32.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if I annoy them or make them angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.43,0:10:38.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was still time and I didn't even\Nhave the courage to talk to my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.99,0:10:42.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never know why he named\Nme as his successor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.47,0:10:45.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And not someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.89,0:10:50.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I want to improve myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.73,0:10:54.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To face the things that scare me, so one
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.71,0:10:59.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Day I could laugh away fear, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.53,0:11:05.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone's out to kill\Nyou, right? Oh, but if
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.41,0:11:07.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you want to go somewhere I won't stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.55,0:11:13.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My job is keeping you safe and\Nnothing will get in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.15,0:11:20.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Madame, I have your report.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.19,0:11:23.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her bodyguard is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.19,0:11:26.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, he might act laid back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.17,0:11:28.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He leaves no openings.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.51,0:11:37.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I super forgot to charge my phone.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:40.13,0:11:42.07,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\fs28\fscx85\b1\c&H070707&)\pos(320,280)}The {\alpha&HFF&\t(120,121,\alpha&H00&)}Sound Master
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.23,0:11:45.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this a game to you?\NI've given you an entire
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.59,0:11:47.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,month and you've made\Nzero progress what am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.93,0:11:50.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,paying you for a party supply company with
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.77,0:11:53.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a market cap of 1.5\Ntrillion yen is at stake
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.69,0:11:56.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As if that meek little\Ngirl is fit to take over
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.53,0:11:59.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so tell me how long\Nuntil you dispose of her?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:01.13,0:12:04.93,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\bord0\shad0\fsp2\fs20\blur0.6\b1\c&H030710&\frz339\pos(81.14,293.14)}3 more days
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.13,0:12:04.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, in a while, when it's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.63,0:12:07.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, don't give me that crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.89,0:12:09.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm paying you to!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.61,0:12:19.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This bodyguard, Oshima!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.79,0:12:22.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You say he's good, but\Nhe's still a nobody!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.43,0:12:25.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And wouldn't last a second\Nagainst a master like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.17,0:12:29.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Madam, I'm a man of my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.39,0:12:31.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In any case,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.07,0:12:34.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,either convince that brat to renounce her
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.91,0:12:38.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,inheritance or leave her\Nunfit to inherit anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.41,0:12:42.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If killing her is what it\Ntakes, then by all means.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.55,0:12:48.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gato,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.46,0:12:52.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you realize you're not a real student\Nand don't have to listen to the lectures.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.33,0:12:54.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never been in a classroom before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.45,0:12:55.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.65,0:12:57.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That backstory is hella tragic.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:58.90,0:13:02.40,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord2\shad0\blur0.3\b1\an7\fnTimes New Roman\frz26\fs13\fax0.23\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(82,73)\frx6\fry0\3c&H7B73DA&}Econ{\3c&H39B8E4&}omics\N\h{\3c&H71CA7E&}Depart{\3c&H7B73DA&}ment
Dialogue: 1,0:12:58.90,0:13:02.40,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\b1\an8\fnArial Black\frz26\fs16\fsp4\fax0.28\pos(235.42,53.72)\c&H827BD2&}ORIENTATION
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.05,0:13:00.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One more day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.19,0:13:01.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You there, in the hoodie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.07,0:13:04.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Name a product that\Ntransformed its industry?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.97,0:13:08.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mixy mix, max mix.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.23,0:13:11.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A hundred of these kits were made\Nfor the brand's 30th anniversary.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.83,0:13:13.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Candy's holy grail.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.75,0:13:14.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.01,0:13:17.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like at least one\Nof you knows their stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.01,0:13:47.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It renewed the Mixi-Mix market!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.25,0:13:49.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A return to the Mix-a-sance!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.25,0:13:52.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because of Mixi-Mix Max-Mix! Fact!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.73,0:13:56.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as there are\Npassionate students like you,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.33,0:14:00.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could retire and leave things\Nin the next generation's hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.77,0:14:05.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have known.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.45,0:14:09.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since they can't separate me from the\Ntarget, they're using brute force.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.67,0:14:11.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who here looks suspicious?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.37,0:14:16.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.89,0:14:20.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I already made sure no one had\Nline of sight into this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.01,0:14:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That attack affected\Nthe whole lecture hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.87,0:14:48.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, this is a well-ventilated\Nenvironment, ruling out a gas attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.63,0:14:51.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which would mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.71,0:14:55.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He injected himself with something\Nthat allowed him to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.33,0:15:00.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sound waves transmitted remotely,\Nto shake the room and its occupants.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.85,0:15:03.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His equilibrium should\Nhave been scrambled,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.27,0:15:06.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but somehow he's\Nsuper-recovered in no time flat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.81,0:15:10.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one could pull off such a precise,\Nlarge-scale attack, except...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.67,0:15:14.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's only one person who could\Nproduce a cure like that in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.57,0:15:16.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A poison master.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.45,0:15:22.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gero!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.65,0:15:25.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The client's been informed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.63,0:15:27.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Making it look like an\Naccident saves trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.95,0:15:29.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Hitman 101.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.71,0:15:32.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ureshino.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.62,0:15:35.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clearly, their intention\Nwas to eliminate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.79,0:15:36.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the plan?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:36.72,0:15:42.73,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord2\shad0\blur0.3\b1\an7\fnTimes New Roman\fs7\fax-0.05\c&HFFFFFF&\frx6\fry0\3c&H5047A8&\frz343.9\move(268.57,22.29,287.57,39.29)}Econ{\3c&H2281A9&}omics\N{\3c&H3F9148&}Depart{\3c&H5047A8&}ment
Dialogue: 1,0:15:36.72,0:15:42.73,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\b1\an8\fnArial Black\fs12\fsp2\fax-0.05\c&H545499&\frz343.9\move(335,81,354,98)}ORIENTATION
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.29,0:15:39.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do we skip the camping trip tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.93,0:15:41.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's up to our client.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.73,0:15:44.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course you can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.53,0:15:46.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really? I can?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.53,0:15:48.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.59,0:15:51.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been looking forward\Nto this trip for ages, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:51.49,0:15:56.49,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an3\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\fs14\fscx80\fay0.31\fax-0.06\fnArial\b1\c&H5254C1&\frx6\fry26\move(414.29,151.43,414.29,171.43)}Shiratori
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.97,0:15:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no substitute for friends\Nyou'll make at university.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.47,0:15:58.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meet as many as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.41,0:16:02.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, with those two around,\Nthere's nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.85,0:16:04.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.45,0:16:07.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uncle Mitsuhiko, I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.87,0:16:10.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.87,0:16:11.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.91,0:16:13.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's kind of a huge bag, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.85,0:16:14.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you pack?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.57,0:16:17.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A collapsible umbrella.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.15,0:16:18.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have a safe trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.13,0:16:19.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, the rest is secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.27,0:16:29.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if she stayed home, there's\Nno way to guarantee her safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.25,0:16:32.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only way to end this\Nis confronting the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.79,0:16:38.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And unlike with Himekawa, we don't\Nknow when the Soundmaster will strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.79,0:16:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is the plan to settle things on this trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.67,0:16:50.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what does this mean?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:49.34,0:16:51.05,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\bord0\shad0\fsp2\fs32\blur0.6\b1\c&H030710&\pos(312.57,179.43)\frz295.7}1 more day
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.93,0:16:53.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An important promise I can't bring.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.31,0:16:55.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're so thoughtful, Naruko.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.09,0:16:57.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a promise I want to make you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.15,0:17:00.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about you make one with me\Nfirst, since I'm closer than her?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.47,0:17:01.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There, we can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.38,0:17:02.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's super important.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.37,0:17:23.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A man who can cook is three\Ntimes hotter to the ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.17,0:17:26.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to unleash those\Nskills on the public.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.47,0:17:32.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll show you I can compete\Nwith the best of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.25,0:17:35.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yakisoba, I made it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.33,0:17:37.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Want to try some?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.35,0:17:40.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.87,0:17:42.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.93,0:17:44.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yakisoba.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.71,0:17:47.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should we step in?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.99,0:17:50.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have fun and don't worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.93,0:17:54.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what Ureshino told us, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.01,0:17:57.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is something she wants\Nto figure out herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.73,0:17:58.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.73,0:18:04.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What can I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.29,0:18:05.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To get them to the lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.25,0:18:08.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sigh, water, stir away, chopped ginger,\Nrice, pepper, and all-absorbent pollen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.85,0:18:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plenty clubs, wild\Nchihuahuas, fortune tellers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.27,0:18:18.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is she okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.15,0:18:27.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If talking to people doesn't\Nwork, I'll try a new approach.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.91,0:18:31.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like the magical girl get-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.25,0:18:39.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you can see, the cloche is empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.55,0:18:41.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now for the magic words.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.25,0:18:44.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pon poodoo pin poodoo pom po poon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.03,0:18:47.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pin poodoo pom poodoo pom po poon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.95,0:18:56.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And for my next trick,\Nan extra big helping.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.73,0:18:59.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pin poodoo pon poodoo pom po poon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.85,0:19:04.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.93,0:19:11.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those were some pretty nifty magic tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.67,0:19:15.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My family's business\Nsells lots of magic stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.15,0:19:18.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never performed in front\Nof a group of people before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.17,0:19:19.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plus I messed up the finale.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.37,0:19:24.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you know I'm not too good with words.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.21,0:19:29.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suddenly it all flooded\Nback the performance Mr Gato
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.09,0:19:32.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,put on at the party and I\Nthought to myself that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.53,0:19:35.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.87,0:19:43.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't really um humble but weird I mean
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.83,0:19:47.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what was that glad I could inspire you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.97,0:19:52.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't think to ask until\Nthis moment but have any
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.37,0:19:54.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of you guys heard about\Nthe curse of Lord Chladni?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.61,0:19:56.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.11,0:19:59.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At one point this used\Nto be a village they
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.61,0:20:01.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,had a local deity and\Nthey made offerings to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.97,0:20:07.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Up until world war ii every couple\Nyears the crops would fail so the
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.05,0:20:11.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,villagers would pick out the youngest\Nchild and sacrifice them to this god.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.47,0:20:15.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They would lock them up inside of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.37,0:20:16.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,shrine over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.03,0:20:44.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After the war, they abandoned the custom.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.19,0:20:50.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But landslides, fires, and several\Nother disasters followed at its peak.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:45.45,0:20:48.95,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\b1\blur0.3\bord0\shad0\fs18\move(386,176,341,192)\frz341.25\t(\frz346.5)\c&H303C43&}Another Fire: Suspected Arson Continues
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.79,0:20:52.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nearly a thousand people lived here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.75,0:20:55.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These days, it's nothing but a ghost town.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.45,0:20:59.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even now,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.09,0:21:04.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord Chladni waits for his next\Noffering and that sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.43,0:21:09.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.17,0:21:12.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if it isn't, not like\Nanyone enjoys a spoil sport.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.29,0:21:15.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oshima.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.20,0:21:17.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of it was true, every last word.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.67,0:21:20.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I would say that\Nwas plenty of build-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.29,0:21:21.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.93,0:21:23.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, let's get this party started.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.21,0:21:28.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the moment you've all been\Nwaiting for, the test of courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.65,0:21:32.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, have you seen Naruko?
